<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kerr-McGee upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kerr-McGee upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Jay Wilson upgraded Kerr-McGee Corp to buy from market performer, saying the recent selloff in the stock had created a buying opportunity.</p>
<p>-- Has 12-month price target of $74 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares were flat at 64-1/4.</p>
</text>
